Description: C++ multiple-precision GMP/MPFR/MPC headers
 gmpfrxx_mkII provides C++ headers and a precision-context provider for
 multiple-precision arithmetic based on GMP, MPFR, and MPC.

Package: libgmpxx-mkii-default-context-provider1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: gmpfrxx_mkII default-context provider runtime
 The gmpfrxx_mkII default-context provider owns the external provider ABI
 and thread-local default context used by consumers of the development
 interface.
